  "notes": "Federal system: 8 years of primary (lower 1–4, upper 5–8) from age 6 and 4 years of secondary. The federal ministry confirms 'Fasalka 12aad' (Grade 12) for the final national exam; the stage split and the Form 1–4 aliases for grades 9–12 are not confirmed by an official source. Somaliland and Puntland run their own ministries and exams."
